            // ─── Airports (5c.2.c.2 + 5c.2.c.3) ─────────────────────
            //
            // All airports homed in CoastalBoreal + bleed-over: true
            // so palette adaptation naturally drifts them to the host
            // biome (weathered wood → desert tan → alpine stone).
            // Placement is gated by `hub_proximity` — each tier-gated
            // feature only emits at cells close to a hub of matching
            // tier, so Major-hub airports never spawn next to a Local
            // bush strip and vice-versa.
            //
            // Runway orientation: all compositions use `direction_rad:
            // 0.0` which places the runway along the world +X axis.
            // A future milestone can randomize per-cell from a small
            // set (0, π/6, π/3, π/2) for more variety; for now the
            // aligned orientation is predictable + debuggable.

